{
  "meta": {
    "title": "LLM Wiki · 知识图谱",
    "description": "持续编译的认知结构——由 LLM Agent 维护，人负责方向",
    "lastUpdated": "2026-07-02",
    "version": "1.0"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "llm-wiki-philosophy",
      "label": "LLM Wiki 理念约束",
      "type": "concept",
      "summary": "十条长期维护约束：编译而非检索、原始资料不可侵犯、增长控制、可追溯、查询回流",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["llm-wiki", "philosophy", "knowledge-management"],
      "source": "https://gist.github.com/Karpathy/442a6bf555914893e9891c11519de94f"
    },
    {
      "id": "compounding-artifact",
      "label": "复利型知识",
      "type": "concept",
      "summary": "Wiki 是持续积累的资产，每次 Ingest 和 Query 都让它更丰富，不是每次都从零检索",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["llm-wiki", "core-principle"]
    },
    {
      "id": "three-layers",
      "label": "三层架构",
      "type": "concept",
      "summary": "原始资料（只读）→ Wiki 层（LLM 维护）→ 规则层（Agent 行为约束）",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["llm-wiki", "architecture"]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-immutability",
      "label": "原始资料不可侵犯",
      "type": "concept",
      "summary": "原始资料是 source of truth，LLM 只读不写；Wiki 是衍生物，错了可以回到原始资料重来",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["llm-wiki", "core-principle"]
    },
    {
      "id": "update-over-create",
      "label": "更新优先于新建",
      "type": "concept",
      "summary": "新信息优先合并到已有页面，新页面只在旧页面装不下时才创建——控制增长速度",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["llm-wiki", "anti-bloat"]
    },
    {
      "id": "query-reflux",
      "label": "查询结果回流",
      "type": "concept",
      "summary": "好的对话结果应归档回 Wiki——探索本身也在积累，不应消失在聊天记录里",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["llm-wiki", "workflow"]
    },
    {
      "id": "llm-wiki-graph-project",
      "label": "llm-wiki-graph",
      "type": "entity",
      "summary": "知识图谱可视化工程——将 graph.json 渲染为交互式力导向图，部署在 GitHub Pages",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["project", "visualization"]
    },
    {
      "id": "gbrain",
      "label": "Gbrain",
      "type": "entity",
      "summary": "ECS 上的中央知识库——语义搜索、页面管理、take 系统。Wiki 层的查询后端",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["tool", "knowledge-base"]
    },
    {
      "id": "obsidian",
      "label": "Obsidian",
      "type": "entity",
      "summary": "Markdown 知识管理 IDE——图视图、Dataview、Web Clipper、模板系统",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["tool", "ide"]
    },
    {
      "id": "ingest-workflow",
      "label": "Ingest 摄取工作流",
      "type": "concept",
      "summary": "新资料→LLM 读取→讨论要点→写摘要→更新索引→更新实体/概念页→追加日志。一次 Ingest 可能触及 10-15 个页面",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["llm-wiki", "workflow"]
    },
    {
      "id": "lint-workflow",
      "label": "Lint 修剪工作流",
      "type": "concept",
      "summary": "周期性巡检：矛盾检测、stale 标记、thin 合并、orphan 清理、缺失交叉引用补充",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["llm-wiki", "workflow"]
    },
    {
      "id": "karpathy",
      "label": "Andrej Karpathy",
      "type": "entity",
      "summary": "LLM Wiki 理念提出者，原 gist 是本知识图谱的奠基文档",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["person", "author"]
    },
    {
      "id": "hermes-agent",
      "label": "Hermes Agent",
      "type": "entity",
      "summary": "Windows 开发机上的主 LLM Agent，负责执行复杂的多工具任务编排",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["tool", "agent"]
    },
    {
      "id": "reverse-engineering-methodology",
      "label": "逆向工程方法论",
      "type": "concept",
      "summary": "三阶段流程：评估（架构/语言/防护）→ 策略路由 → 输出可执行方案。与 Wiki 三层架构同构",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["reverse-engineering", "methodology"]
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-vs-anti-bloat",
      "label": "AI 时代的信息膨胀问题",
      "type": "question",
      "summary": "LLM 可以无限生成内容——如何确保 Wiki 不会变成空洞的页面堆？修剪机制是否足够？",
      "status": "active",
      "tags": ["llm-wiki", "risk"]
    },
